  "fullDescription": "Add a festive and playful touch to your holiday collection with this Christmas Character Planter Set STL 3D Print. This set includes three charming Christmas-inspired planters featuring Santa Claus, a Snowman, and a Christmas Angel. Each character has a unique decorative design, colorful holiday details, and an integrated open planter section for small plants or seasonal greenery.\n\nPerfect for Christmas home decor, holiday tabletop displays, mantel and shelf decoration, entryways, festive centerpieces, small plants, succulents, faux greenery, and Christmas-themed interiors. The coordinated Santa, Snowman, and Angel designs can be displayed together as a complete holiday collection or separately throughout your home. Current Creative Fabrica listings show strong related demand around Christmas character sets, Christmas snowmen, angels, gnomes, and decorative holiday 3D-print models.\n\nThe model can be colored using software such as Bambu Studio, PrusaSlicer, Cura, or other compatible slicer software, allowing you to customize different parts/details with your preferred colors.\n\nDigital 3D model only. No physical product is included.\n\n✨ Perfect For\nChristmas character planters\nSanta Claus planter decor\nSnowman planter decor\nChristmas angel decor\nHoliday tabletop displays\nMantel & shelf decoration\nChristmas centerpieces\nSmall plants & succulents\nFestive home decor\nChristmas gift projects",
